'''Abyss Eye''' (Japanese: '''アビスアイ''' ''Abyss Eye'') is the name given to the fifth expansion of cards released during the Japanese [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s MEGA Series. This set is based on the [[Mega Dimension]] DLC of the video game {{g|Legends: Z-A}} and features {{me|Darkrai}} as the central Pokémon.

==Information==
'''Abyss Eye''' is the first set to be based on the [[Mega Dimension]] DLC for {{g|Legends: Z-A}}, and continues to introduce {{TCG|Pokémon ex|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} and Trainer cards from the video game. The set primarily focuses on {{TCG ID|Abyss Eye|Mega Darkrai ex|46}} as the central Pokémon.

Abyss Eye was released in {{pmin|Japan}} on May 22, 2026, followed by localized releases in {{pmin|Taiwan}} and {{pmin|Hong Kong}} on June 5, 2026, and in {{pmin|South Korea}} on June 26, 2026. Each booster pack contains 5 cards. Each booster box contains 30 packs. Cards released in this set are included in the English {{TCG|Pitch Black}} expansion.

Abyss Eye was first revealed to the public on April 17, 2026, the date of a {{wp|new moon}}, which is said to be when Darkrai is active.

