'''Scarlet & Violet: Ace Paradox''' (Indonesian: '''Paradoks Andalan''') is the name given to the special {{pmin|Indonesia}}n-exclusive set released in the Asian Scarlet & Violet Era of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It is a combination of the Japanese {{TCG|Wild Force}} and {{TCG|Cyber Judge}} expansions.

==Information==
'''Ace Paradox''' is the third Indonesian-exclusive set for the Asian Scarlet & Violet Era of the {{PTCG}}, released on March 29, 2024 — this is also the same date in which the {{TCG|Standard format}} rotates in Indonesia to exclude cards with regulation mark E, and include only cards with regulation mark F or later. The Ace Paradox set combines the Japanese {{TCG|Wild Force}} and {{TCG|Cyber Judge}} expansions, and continues to introduce {{TCG|Ancient}} and {{TCG|Future}} cards, as well as introducing {{TCG|ACE SPEC card}}s to the Indonesian TCG meta for the first time. Each booster pack of Ace Paradox contains 5 cards.

Besides being sold in individual boosters and boxes of 30 packs, Ace Paradox is also available in 2-pack blisters known as "Special Set" (Indonesian: '''Set Spesial'''), which are exclusively sold in Indonesian convenience store chain {{wp|Indomaret}}. Each Special Set contains a Holo promo card of {{TCG ID|SV-P Promo|Litten|98}}, {{TCG ID|SV-P Promo|Totodile|99}}, or {{TCG ID|SV-P Promo|Pikachu|100}} with the Ace Paradox logo stamped on the bottom right corner of the artwork.

