=== Pokémon UNITE collaboration ===
As part of a collaboration with [[Pokémon UNITE]], each booster pack contained a gift code card that players could redeem for a chance to obtain special {{p|Miraidon}}-themed items, including a Miraidon Suit, a Miraidon Shirt, or a Miraidon Frame for profile pictures.<ref name="unitecollab"/>

