'''Pokémon TCG: ''XY—BREAKpoint''''' (Japanese: '''{{ruby|破天|はてん}}の{{ruby|怒|いか}}り''' ''Rage of the Broken Heavens'') is the name given to the ninth main expansion of cards from the XY Series of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] (the XY BREAK Era in Japan). The set continues to feature [[Generation VI]] Pokémon, {{TCG|Pokémon-EX|Pokémon-EX, M Pokémon-EX}}, and {{TCG|Pokémon BREAK}} in the card game.

==Blurb==
<i>A Rift Torn Between Worlds!

The hour grows desperate, and two worlds stand at the brink! The Pokémon TCG: XY—BREAKpoint expansion reveals the growing rift between the twin worlds, first discovered by Shiny Mega Gyarados-EX. As the rift tears through the skies, more Pokémon are drawn into the struggle, including Greninja BREAK, Luxray BREAK, and Mega Scizor-EX! Can they mend the rift and save both worlds from collision chaos?</i>

==Information==
[[File:XY9 Logo.png|200px|thumb|Rage of the Broken Heavens logo]]
'''BREAKpoint''' is the name given to the ninth main expansion of the ''XY Series'' of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. In Japan, it was released as '''Rage of the Broken Heavens''', the second expansion in the Pokémon Card Game XY BREAK Era. It is based on [[Pokémon Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire]], featuring [[Generation VI]] Pokémon and the Atrocious Pokémon {{p|Gyarados}} in its {{Shiny}} form. The English expansion was released on February 3, 2016, while the Japanese expansion was released on December 11, 2015.

