'''Battle Partners''' (Japanese: '''バトルパートナーズ''') is the name given to the ninth Japanese expansion of cards released during the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s Scarlet & Violet Era.

==Information==
'''Battle Partners''' was officially revealed during the Latest News presentation on Day 1 of the Osaka Champion's League 2025 competition held from December 21-22, 2024.<ref>[https://www.youtube.com/live/xiyiVx8XNj8?si=6K8JQoj02gQBfxml&t=24403 Champion's League 2025 Osaka livestream - Latest News]</ref> A short teaser of the featured cards was revealed on August 18, 2024 during the closing ceremony of the [[2024 Pokémon World Championships]].<ref>[https://www.pokemon.com/us/pokemon-news/2024-pokemon-world-championships-closing-ceremony-recap 2024 Pokémon World Championships Closing Ceremony Recap | Pokémon.com]</ref>

The expansion features the return of {{TCG|Trainer's Pokémon}},<ref>[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k8phvYRz1f4 Trainer’s Pokémon Return to Pokémon TCG | Official Pokémon Worlds Reveal]</ref> a game mechanic originally introduced in the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion. The booster pack for the expansion features [[N]] and {{p|Zoroark}}, [[Lillie]] and {{p|Clefairy}}, [[Hop]] and {{p|Zacian}}, and [[Iono]] and {{p|Bellibolt}}.

Released on the same day were the {{TCG|Battle Partners Deck Build Box}}, the ''{{TCG|Collection File Sets|Collection File Set}} N'', and the ''Collection File Set Lillie''. Each booster box contains 30 {{TCG|booster pack}}s. A {{TCG|SV-P Promotional cards|SV-P Promo}} {{TCG ID|SV-P Promo|Iono's Wattrel|232}} was released alongside the set as a purchase bonus for buying a booster box.

Battle Partners was released in Japan on January 24, 2025, followed by localized releases in {{pmin|Chinese|Traditional Chinese}} on February 7, 2025, and in {{pmin|South Korea|Korean}} on March 21, 2025. The {{pmin|Thailand|Thai}} and {{pmin|Indonesia}}n equivalent set, {{ATCG|Bonds of Destiny}}, was released on April 11, 2025 and April 18, 2025 respectively. Cards released in this set are included in the English {{TCG|Journey Together}} expansion.

