'''Scarlet & Violet: Black & White''' is the name given to the special set released in the Asian Scarlet & Violet Era of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It is an {{pmin|Indonesia}}- and {{pmin|Thailand}}-exclusive adaptation of {{TCG|Black Bolt/White Flare}}, the tenth subset and the eleventh main TCG expansion of Japanese Scarlet & Violet Era, respectively.

==Information==
'''Black & White''', known in Indonesian as '''Hitam & Putih''' and in Thai as '''แบล็ก & ไวท์''', is a special set exclusive to Indonesia and Thailand released for the Asian Scarlet & Violet Era of the {{PTCG}}. It is the ninth such set for the Indonesian market, and the fifth such set for the Thai market. It is largely an adaptation of the Japanese {{TCG|Black Bolt/White Flare}} expansion, which includes a new rarity of cards called BWR (BW Rare), which includes {{p|Zekrom}} ex and {{p|Reshiram}} ex. Unlike Japanese release, it is a unified expansion rather than paired sets. Each booster pack of Black & White contains 5 cards.

Black & White was released in Thailand on July 11, 2025, and in Indonesia on July 25, 2025. A Collector's Set (Indonesian: Set Kolektor) for Black & White was available for sale at the same time as the set's release in Indonesia. The Indonesian Black & White Collector's Set contains 10 booster packs, a card list booklet, and a stamped Full Art promo card of Zorua.

