'''Scarlet & Violet: Black Shine''' (Indonesian: '''Kilau Hitam''') is the name given to the special {{pmin|Indonesia}}n-exclusive catch-up set released in the Asian Scarlet & Violet Era of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].

==Information==
[[File:Pokémon TCG Indonesia logo 2023.png|thumb|150px|Logo used on all Indonesian Pokémon TCG products since October 27, 2023]]
'''Black Shine''' is the first Indonesian-exclusive set for the Asian Scarlet & Violet Era of the {{PTCG}}, released on October 27, 2023. This set combines the Japanese {{TCG|Ruler of the Black Flame}} expansion and the {{TCG|Raging Surf}} subset, and introduces type-shifted Tera {{TCG|Pokémon ex}} cards to the Indonesian market for the first time. Each booster pack of Black Shine contains 5 cards.

This set's release marks a change to how Indonesian Pokémon TCG products are structured and distributed. Beginning with this set, Indonesian Pokémon TCG sets would comprise more cards and be sold over a longer distribution period. This set is also the first to include a new logo for the Indonesian Pokémon Trading Card Game, which would be used on Indonesian TCG products, events, stores, and other related properties from this set's release onward.

