'''Blue Blaze''' is the second main expansion of cards from the Asian Mega Evolution Series of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], released exclusively in {{pmin|Indonesia}} and {{pmin|Thailand}}. It is an adaptation of the Japanese {{TCG|Inferno X}} expansion, and features Mega {{p|Charizard}} X as the central Pokémon.

==Information==
'''Blue Blaze''', known in Indonesian as '''Kobaran Biru''' and in Thai as '''อัคคีสีคราม''', is the second main expansion of cards for the Asian Mega Evolution Series of the {{PTCG}}, exclusively released in Indonesia and Thailand. It contains cards from the following Japanese TCG products: the {{TCG|Inferno X}} expansion, the {{TCG|MEGA Starter Set Mega Gengar ex}} and {{TCG|MEGA Starter Set Mega Diancie ex}}, and the {{TCG|Premium Trainer Box MEGA}}. Composition-wise, the set closely resembles the English {{TCG|Phantasmal Flames}} expansion, but with the addition of the Premium Trainer Box MEGA cards that on the English release were instead included in the {{TCG|Mega Evolution}} expansion.

The expansion features more [[Mega Evolution]] into the Indonesian and Thai metagame as {{TCG|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} cards, including {{TCG ID|Blue Blaze|Mega Charizard X ex|13}} as the central Pokémon. Each booster pack of Blue Blaze contains 5 cards.

Blue Blaze releases in Thailand on November 7, 2025, and in Indonesia on December 5, 2025; the original release date in Indonesia was November 28, 2025, but it was delayed by one week due to late shipping. Besides being sold in individual boosters and boxes of 30 packs, Blue Blaze is also available in 2-pack blisters known as "Special Set" (Indonesian: '''Set Spesial'''; Thai: '''สเปเชียลเซ็ต''').

For the Indonesian release, the "10-Pack Set Plus" (Indonesian: Set 10 Pak PLUS) product was also introduced, adapting the Taiwan and Hong Kong product of the same name. The Blue Blaze 10-Pack Set Plus contains 10 booster packs, a cardboard deck case, and a promo card pack. The promo card pack contains one random selection of three sets of Holofoil {{ITCG|M-P Promotional cards|M-P Promotional}} Pokémon cards with the Blue Blaze logo on the artwork, plus 5 Basic Energy cards matching the Pokémon's types. The M-P Promo selection are as follows:
* Fire set: {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Charmander|26}}, {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Charmeleon|27}}, and {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Moltres|28}}, plus 5 {{TCG|Basic Fire Energy}}
* Metal set: {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Piplup|29}}, {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Prinplup|30}}, and {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Dawn|34}}, plus 5 {{TCG|Basic Metal Energy}}
* Darkness set: {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Sneasel|31}}, {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Carvanha|32}}, and {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Toxel|33}}, plus 5 {{TCG|Basic Darkness Energy}}

