==Blurb==
<i>Fiery Battles and Deep Shadows!

What strange fires lurk in the shadows? Minions of Team Skull and a cavalcade of new Pokémon stand ready to battle in the dark of night and in the blazing sun! Slug it out with new titans like Necrozma-GX, Marshadow-GX, and Tapu Fini-GX, or battle with trusty allies from Machamp-GX and Charizard-GX to Darkrai-GX and Ho-Oh-GX. Fight for what's right with the Pokémon TCG: Sun & Moon—Burning Shadows expansion!</i>

==Information==
[[File:SM3 Logo.png|200px|thumb|To Have Seen the Battle Rainbow •<br>Darkness that Consumes Light logos]]
'''Burning Shadows''' is the name given to the third main expansion of the ''Sun & Moon Series'' of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. In Japan, it was released as the '''To Have Seen the Battle Rainbow''' and '''Darkness that Consumes Light''' dual expansions that make up the third expansion block in the Pokémon Card Game Sun & Moon Era. It is based on [[Pokémon Sun and Moon]], featuring [[Generation VII]] Pokémon and the Prism Pokémon {{p|Necrozma}}. The English expansion was released on August 4, 2017, while the Japanese expansions were released on June 16, 2017. Burning Shadows is composed of its Japanese equivalent as well as the {{TCG|Facing a New Trial}} subset.

