==Languages this set is released in==
The To Have Seen the Battle Rainbow and Darkness that Consumes Light sets are released in Japanese and Korean, both only available in unlimited edition. Since the Sun & Moon era, Japanese 1st edition cards are no longer printed. The Burning Shadows set is released in English, German, French, Italian, Spanish, and Portuguese, with cards also available as Reverse Holos.

