===Booster packs===
Several different booster packs will be made available for the expansion throughout 2025, each with a slightly different pool of cards available and with altered pull rates.<ref>[https://special.pokemon.cn/151/ 宝可梦卡牌 收集啦151]</ref> Two have so far been released, and two more revealed:

* The first booster pack, subtitled '''Journey''' ('''旅''' ''Journey''), was released on January 17, 2025 and includes {{TCG ID|151|Pikachu|25}} (#170);
* The second booster pack, subtitled '''Hope''' ('''望''' ''Hope''), was released on April 18, 2025 and includes {{TCG ID|151|Pikachu|25}} (#171);
* The third booster pack, subtitled '''Scare''' ('''惊''' ''Scare''), was released on July 18, 2025 and includes {{TCG ID|151|Pikachu|25}} (#172), {{TCG ID|151|Alakazam ex|65}} (#189), and {{TCG ID|151|Mew ex|151}} (#191);
* The fourth booster pack, subtitled '''Gather''' ('''聚''' ''Gather''), was released on October 17, 2025 and includes {{TCG ID|151|Pikachu|25}} (#173) and {{TCG ID|151|Zapdos ex|145}} (#190).

Journey, Hope, Scare, and Gather booster packs are available in two different configurations:
* 5-card booster packs; one card will either be Reverse Holofoil or have a rarity of Rare or higher;
* 20-card booster packs; seven cards will either be Reverse Holofoil or have a rarity of Rare or higher.

Players can also obtain special two-card event packs by participating in special events or by purchasing certain products; these can consist of any cards in the expansion, including Reverse Holofoil variants, with the exception of illustration rare and special illustration rare cards.<ref>[https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/2024122202.html 2024-12-22 好“集”了！有机会免费获得“151”卡册和“151”卡牌？！ | 集换式卡牌游戏 | The official Pokémon Website in China]</ref> Event packs were available from January 18, 2025, the same day as the Journey booster pack.

