'''Pokémon TCG: ''Detective Pikachu''''' (Japanese: '''ムービースペシャルパック 名探偵ピカチュウ''' ''Movie Special Pack Great Detective Pikachu'') is a special expansion of cards from the Sun & Moon Series of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It was released as a promotional set in the Pokémon Card Game in Japan.

==Information==
'''Detective Pikachu''' is a special expansion of the ''Sun & Moon Series'' of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It was released in anticipation of the live-action Pokémon movie, {{DetPikMov}}. It featured Pokémon that appeared in the movie and were made as 3D art by the visual effects studios that worked on the film, the [[Moving Picture Company]] and [[Framestore]].

Unlike regular expansions, Detective Pikachu booster packs could not be purchased individually from booster boxes. Instead, they were only made available in various set-related merchandise, the first of which was released on March 29, 2019. Each booster pack contained four Holofoil cards.

The Japanese equivalent '''Movie Special Pack Great Detective Pikachu''' is a 25 card promotional set that was released on April 26, 2019. Each booster pack contained 3 Common cards and an Uncommon card or above. Each booster box contained 20 packs and guaranteed to form a complete set<ref>[https://www.pokemon-card.com/ex/smp2/ Buy a box to collect all cards, including the precious SR card!]</ref>. All Common and Uncommon cards included within the Japanese release are Mirror Holofoil.

