==Languages this set is released in==
The Space-Time Creation set (Diamond & Pearl Collection sets) was released exclusively in Japanese, in both {{TCG|1st Edition}} and Unlimited Edition. The Diamond & Pearl set is released in English, German, French, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, and Polish. Cards in the English, German, French, Italian, and Polish sets were also available in [[Reverse Holofoil]]. The Spanish and Portuguese versions of this set lacked any Reverse Holofoil cards.

