'''Pokémon TCG: ''Dragon Majesty''''' (Japanese: '''強化拡張パック ドラゴンストーム''' ''Enhanced Expansion Pack Dragon Storm'') is a special expansion of cards from the Sun & Moon Series of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It was released as the seventh subset from the Sun & Moon Era of the Pokémon Card Game in Japan.

==Blurb==
<i>Dragons in Majestic Flight!

Noble Pokémon of wing and claw, flying high above the changing world! The Pokémon TCG: Dragon Majesty expansion brings a mighty horde of draconic Pokémon: Reshiram-GX, Salamence-GX, Dragonite-GX, and over a dozen more, including Charizard! Their command of fire, battle, and sky puts Dragon types at the top of many Trainers' lists—get to know these amazing and challenging Pokémon in the Dragon Majesty expansion!</i>

==Information==
[[File:SM6a Logo.png|200px|thumb|Dragon Storm logo]]
'''Dragon Majesty''' is a special expansion of the ''Sun & Moon Series'' of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. In Japan, it was released as '''Dragon Storm''', the seventh subset in the Pokémon Card Game Sun & Moon Era. It was the first to be considered as an enhancement of the sixth Sun & Moon Era main expansion, {{TCG|Forbidden Light}}.

Unlike regular expansions, Dragon Majesty booster packs could not be purchased individually from booster boxes. Instead, they were only made available in various set-related merchandise, the first of which was released on September 7, 2018.

The Japanese subset was released on April 6, 2018.

Dragon Majesty's set symbol is the letter D, stylized to look like a dragon.

