==Languages this set is released in==
The Dragon Blast and Dragon Blade sets are released in Japanese and Korean. The Japanese set is available in both 1st and unlimited edition, and the Korean set is only available in unlimited edition. Cards in the English, German, French, Italian, and Spanish sets were also available as Reverse Holos. The Portuguese version of this set lacked any Reverse Holos. In Italy, additional Mirror Reverse Holofoil variants of [[uncommon]] Pokémon cards were also distributed exclusively through [[Black & White Italian TCG Series merchandise#Bauli Pokémon Easter Eggs|Bauli Pokémon Easter Eggs]].

