'''Sun & Moon: Dreams Come True Collection''' (Chinese: '''太陽 & 月亮 美夢成真組合篇''' ''Sun & Moon Dreams Come True Collection'') is the name given to the second of three Sun & Moon Era amalgamated catch-up "Collections" in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It is exclusively available in Traditional Chinese and is an amalgamation of the {{ATCG|Hidden Shadow}} and {{ATCG|Sky Ruler}} catch-up sets that were released in Indonesian and Thai.

==Information==
Following on from the {{ATCG|All Stars Collection}}, the '''Dreams Come True Collection''' was released on December 20, 2019 in Taiwan and Hong Kong. This set is composed of cards from the Japanese Sun & Moon Era. It is split into two sets, Set A and Set B, each of which focuses on specific types. Set A features {{ct|Grass}}, {{ct|Psychic}}, {{ct|Fighting}}, {{ct|Darkness}}, and {{ct|Dragon}} Pokémon, while Set B features {{ct|Fire}}, {{ct|Water}}, {{ct|Lightning}}, {{ct|Metal}}, {{ct|Fairy}}, and {{ct|Dragon}} Pokémon. Each pack contains seven cards, including a guaranteed Holofoil card.

