==Languages this set is released in==
The Holon Research Tower set is only released in Japanese, in both 1st and unlimited edition. The EX Delta Species set is released in English, German, French, and Italian, with cards also available as Reverse Holofoils. The non-Holo Commons in the English, German, French, and Italian sets have three different codes available in the bottom-left corner of the card; the Japanese set only uses a single code for each card. The purpose of these different codes is still unknown, but occurred throughout the first halve of the EX era.

