==Languages this set is released in==
The Undone Seal set is only released in Japanese, in both 1st and unlimited edition. The EX Hidden Legends set is released in English, French, and Italian, with cards also available as Reverse Holofoils. The non-holo Uncommons in the Japanese, English, French, and Italian sets are available with two different codes at the bottom-left; the non-holo Commons in the Japanese set are available with four different codes at the bottom-left; and the non-Holo Commons in the English, French, and Italian sets have three different codes available. The purpose of these different codes is still unknown, but occurred throughout the first halve of the EX era.

