'''Pokémon TCG: ''EX Holon Phantoms''''' (Japanese: '''ホロンの幻影''' ''Holon Phantom'') is the name given to the thirteenth main expansion of cards from the EX Series of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It is the seventh main expansion from the PCG Era of the Pokémon Card Game in Japan. The set continues to feature [[Generation III]] Pokémon, {{TCG|Pokémon-ex}}, and {{TCG|Pokémon ☆}} in the card game.

==Blurb==
<i>Where Shadows Fall, Phantoms Dwell

What mysteries await the bold Trainer who ventures into the unknown lands beyond the labs of Holon? In EX Holon Phantoms, there's only one way to find out—step into the shadows! With more mysterious Pokémon Delta Species to discover, EX Holon Phantoms dares you to find what you've never seen before. You might think there's no such thing as phantoms...until you catch one!</i>

==Information==
'''EX Holon Phantoms''' is the name given to the thirteenth main expansion of the ''EX Series'' of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. In Japan, it was released as '''Holon Phantom''', the seventh expansion in the Pokémon Card Game PCG Era. This set features [[Generation III]] Pokémon. The English expansion was released on May 3, 2006, while the Japanese expansion was released on January 27, 2006.

Prerelease events were held during the weekends of April 22nd-23rd and April 29th-30th.<ref>https://web.archive.org/web/20080413034252/http://www.op.pokemon-tcg.com/events/locator/?event_type=28&location=north_america</ref>

The expansion was set in [[Holon]], south of the city around which {{TCG|EX Delta Species}} was based. Because of the more natural habitat, fewer of the Delta Species Pokémon are dual-type.

The Reverse Holofoil started to feature the plain "refractor" Holofoil on the background of the artwork.

