==Languages this set is released in==
The ADV Expansion Pack was released in both Japanese and Korean. The Japanese set was available in both 1st and unlimited edition, while the Korean set was only available in 1st edition.

The EX Ruby & Sapphire expansion was released in English, French, German, Italian, Spanish, and Portuguese, with cards in all of these languages also available as Reverse Holos. All non-English releases used the updated card design without the [[e-Reader]] dot code strips or "''e''" logo.

Many non-holo cards were printed with multiple codes in the bottom-left corner:
* Japanese non-holo Commons have four different codes, while non-holo Uncommons have two.
* English, French, German, Italian, Spanish, and Portuguese non-holo Commons have three different codes, while non-holo Uncommons have two.
* Korean cards have only one code per card.

The purpose of these different codes is unknown. Similar code variations appeared throughout the first half of the EX Series.

