==Languages this set is released in==
The Magma VS Aqua: Two Ambitions set is only released in Japanese, in both 1st and unlimited edition. The EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua set is released in English, French, German, and Italian, with cards also available as Reverse Holos. Unlike other sets during the EX era, the non-holo Commons and Uncommons in this set only had a single distinct code available per card.

