==Languages this set is released in==
The Expansion Pack 20th Anniversary set is released in Japanese, while the BASE PACK 20th Anniversary set was released in Korean. The Japanese set is only available in 1st edition, and the Korean set is only available in unlimited edition. The Evolutions set is released in English, German, French, Italian, and Spanish, with cards also available as Reverse Holos.

