'''Ancient Guardians''' (Korean: '''고대의 수호자''' ''Godae-ui Suhoja'') is the name given to the tenth extension set of cards from the DP Series of the {{pmin|South Korea|Korean}} [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. The set continues to feature {{TCG|Pokémon LV.X}}. This set does not focus on any particular type.

==Information==
'''Ancient Guardians''' is the tenth Korean extension set of cards after the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] went into hiatus until the middle of 2010. Released March 3, 2011, this extension set continues to introduce both new [[Generation IV]] Pokémon and new {{TCG|Pokémon LV.X}} in the Korean Card Game. This set does not focus on any particular type.

Included in the Ancient Guardians set are 40 cards originating from the first half of the English Diamond & Pearl Series. The set pulls its Ultra-Rare {{TCG|Pokémon LV.X}} focus from the {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} and {{TCG|Stormfront}} expansions and contains a majority of cards from {{TCG|Legends Awakened}} and {{TCG|Great Encounters}}.

The only [[Legendary Pokémon]] included in the set are {{p|Regice}}, {{p|Regirock}}, {{p|Registeel}}, {{p|Regigigas}} (twice), {{p|Kyogre}}, and {{p|Mewtwo}}.

