'''Pokémon TCG: ''XY—Fates Collide''''' (Japanese: '''めざめる{{ruby|超王|ちょうおう}}''' ''Awakening Psychic King'') is the name given to the tenth main expansion of cards from the XY Series of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] (the XY BREAK Era in Japan). The set continues to feature [[Generation VI]] Pokémon, {{TCG|Pokémon-EX|Pokémon-EX, M Pokémon-EX}}, and {{TCG|Pokémon BREAK}} in the card game.

==Blurb==
<i>Reality Shifts—and Is Remade!

Mega Alakazam-EX sees the future—and shapes it to unify two worlds! The Legendary Pokémon Zygarde arrives in many different Formes to bring order, together with Lugia BREAK, Mega Altaria-EX, and Umbreon-EX. Fates are sealed, and two Pokémon worlds join together in the Pokémon TCG: XY—Fates Collide expansion!</i>

==Information==
[[File:XY10 Logo.png|200px|thumb|Awakening Psychic King logo]]
'''Fates Collide''' is the name given to the tenth main expansion of the ''XY Series'' of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. In Japan, it was released as '''Awakening Psychic King''', the third expansion in the Pokémon Card Game XY BREAK Era. It is based on [[Pokémon X and Y]], featuring [[Generation VI]] Pokémon, the Psi Pokémon {{p|Alakazam}}, and the Order Pokémon {{p|Zygarde}} and {{DL|List of Pokémon with form differences|Zygarde|its three Formes}}. The English expansion was released on May 2, 2016, while the Japanese expansion was released on March 18, 2016.

