'''Gem Pack Vol. 1''' (Simplified Chinese: '''宝石包''') is a special subset released for the {{pmin|mainland China|Simplified Chinese}} [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] during the Scarlet & Violet Series.

== Information ==
'''Gem Pack Vol. 1''' is part of the Simplified Chinese-exclusive Gem Pack series. It focuses primarily on Pokémon and characters in the ''[[Pokémon Horizons: The Series]]'' [[animated series]]. Key cards, which are exclusive to Gem Pack Vol. 1 and not released in other languages, feature [[Liko]] and [[Liko's Meowscarada|her Sprigatito]], [[Roy]] and [[Roy's Skeledirge|his Fuecoco]], [[Dot]] and [[Dot's Quaquaval|her Quaxly]], and [[Friede]] and [[Captain Pikachu]].

Each Pokémon in the subset appears across seven numbered cards; two each of {{rar|Gem C}} and {{rar|Gem U}} rarity, and one each of {{rar|Gem R}}, {{rar|Gem RR}}, and {{rar|Gem RRR}} rarity.
