'''Scarlet & Violet: Pokémon Gem Pack Vol. 2''' (Simplified Chinese: '''朱&紫 Pokémon宝石包VOL.2''') is a special subset released for the {{pmin|mainland China|Simplified Chinese}} [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] during the Scarlet & Violet Series.

== Information ==
'''Gem Pack Vol. 2''' is part of the Simplified Chinese-exclusive Gem Pack series. It focuses primarily on the [[Eeveelution]]s.

Each Pokémon in the subset appears across seven numbered cards; two each of {{rar|Gem C}} and {{rar|Gem U}} rarity, and one each of {{rar|Gem R}}, {{rar|Gem RR}}, and {{rar|Gem RRR}} rarity.
{{-}}

