'''Scarlet & Violet: Pokémon Gem Pack Vol. 5''' (Simplified Chinese: '''朱&紫 Pokémon宝石包VOL.5''') is a special subset released for the {{pmin|mainland China|Simplified Chinese}} [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] during the Scarlet & Violet Series.

== Information ==
[[File:CBB5 banner.png|thumb|300px|Site Banner celebrating the release of the set]]
'''Gem Pack Vol. 5''' is part of the Simplified Chinese-exclusive Gem Pack series. Much like {{ATCG|Gem Pack Vol. 1}}, it focuses primarily on Pokémon and characters in the ''[[Pokémon Horizons: The Series]]'' [[animated series]]. Key cards, which are exclusive to Gem Pack Vol. 5 and not released in other languages, feature [[Friede]] and [[Captain Pikachu]], [[Liko]] and [[Liko's Floragato|her Floragato]], [[Roy]] and [[Roy's Crocalor|his Crocalor]], and [[Dot]] and [[Dot's Quaxly|her Quaxly]]. Other related Pokémon featured in the set include:

* {{p|Magneton}} (one was owned by [[Spinel]] before it evolved into {{p|Magnezone}});
* {{p|Chansey}} (one is [[Mollie's Chansey|owned]] by [[Mollie]]);
* {{p|Skarmory}} (two are owned by [[Onia]] and [[Zirc]]);
* {{p|Milcery}} (one was owned by [[Murdock]] before it evolved into [[Murdock's Alcremie|Alcremie]]);
* {{p|Ceruledge}} (one is [[Amethio's Ceruledge|owned]] by [[Amethio]]);
* {{p|Wattrel}} (one was caught by [[Roy]] and later evolved into [[Roy's Kilowattrel|Kilowattrel]]);
* {{p|Tatsugiri}} (three [[Rising Volt Tacklers#Tatsugiri (×3)|live aboard]] the [[Brave Olivine]] with the [[Rising Volt Tacklers]]).

Each Pokémon in the subset appears across seven numbered cards; two each of {{rar|Gem C}} and {{rar|Gem U}} rarity, and one each of {{rar|Gem R}}, {{rar|Gem RR}}, and {{rar|Gem RRR}} rarity.
