'''Glory of the Rocket Gang''' (Japanese: '''ロケット団の栄光'''), also colloquially known as '''Glory of Team Rocket''', is the name given to the tenth Japanese expansion of cards released during the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s Scarlet & Violet Era. This set features [[Team Rocket]] and introduces additional {{TCG|Trainer's Pokémon}}.

==Information==
'''Glory of the Rocket Gang''' was released in Japan on April 18, 2025.<ref>[https://www.play-asia.com/pokemon-card-game-scarlet-violet-expansion-pack-glory-of-team-r/13/70hucn playasia.com]</ref> Each booster box contains 30 {{TCG|booster pack}}s. [[Giovanni]] and {{p|Mewtwo}} are featured on the booster pack artwork. The accessories releasing for the expansion are [[Team Rocket]] themed.<ref>[https://x.com/lantana2024/status/1848529140967993840 lantana2024 - Twitter]</ref> Many cards in this set are Team Rocket's Pokémon, using the same mechanics as Owner's Pokémon. The picture featuring the trainer on the bottom right of the artwork varies between different cards.

Cards released in this set are included in the English {{TCG|Destined Rivals}} expansion.

