'''Pokémon TCG: ''Diamond & Pearl—Great Encounters''''' is the name given to the fourth main expansion of cards from the Diamond & Pearl Series of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. The set continues to feature [[Generation IV]] Pokémon and {{TCG|Pokémon LV.X}} in the card game.

==Blurb==
<i>Witness Legendary Battles... Experience Great Encounters

Dialga. Palkia. Darkrai. Who will stand victorious? In the Pokémon TCG: Diamond & Pearl—Great Encounters expansion, these three incredible legends come together to battle one another in an epic confrontation that will be a triumph for Trainers everywhere! With more brand-new Pokémon, more Pokémon LV.X, and a titanic clash of some of the most powerful Pokémon ever, Great Encounters is your chance to encounter greatness!</i>

==Information==
'''Great Encounters''' is the name given to the fourth main expansion of the ''Diamond & Pearl Series'' of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It is based on {{game|Diamond and Pearl|s}}, featuring [[Generation IV]] Pokémon. It was released on February 13, 2008.

In North America, prerelease events were held during the weekends of February 2nd–3rd and February 9th–10th.<ref>https://web.archive.org/web/20080415005513/http://op.pokemon-tcg.com/events/locator/?event_type=56&location=north_america</ref>

Due to the six-month gap between the release of the fourth expansion block ({{TCG|Moonlit Pursuit}} and {{TCG|Dawn Dash}}) and the fifth expansion block ({{TCG|Cry from the Mysterious}} and {{TCG|Temple of Anger}}), Moonlit Pursuit and Dawn Dash were separated into two English expansions. Great Encounters mostly contained cards from the Moonlit Pursuit expansion.

