'''Hidden Powers''' (Korean: '''보이지 않는 힘''' ''Boiji Anhneun Him'') is the name given to the seventh extension set of cards from the DP Series of the {{pmin|South Korea|Korean}} [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. The set continues to feature {{TCG|Pokémon LV.X}}. Despite having a large range of types, this set focuses on {{ct|Grass}}, {{ct|Water}}, and {{ct|Psychic}} cards.

==Information==
'''Hidden Powers''' is the seventh Korean extension set of cards after the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] went into hiatus until the middle of 2010. Released December 9, 2010, this extension set continues to introduce both new [[Generation IV]] Pokémon and new {{TCG|Pokémon LV.X}} in the Korean Card Game. This set focuses on {{ct|Grass}}, {{ct|Water}}, and {{ct|Psychic}} cards.

Included in the Mystical Seven set are 40 cards originating from the early half of the English Diamond & Pearl Series. The set pulls its Ultra-Rare {{TCG|Pokémon LV.X}} focus from the {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} and {{TCG|Majestic Dawn}} expansions and contains a majority of cards from the {{TCG|Mysterious Treasures}} and {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} expansions.

The only [[Legendary Pokémon]] included in the set are {{TCG ID|Hidden Powers|Celebi|2}} and {{TCG ID|Hidden Powers|Ho-Oh|8}}.

