'''Sun & Moon: Hidden Shadow''' is the name given to the third of six Asian Sun & Moon Era catch-up sets in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It is exclusively available in {{pmin|Indonesia}}n and {{pmin|Thailand|Thai}}. The Traditional Chinese counterpart collection to this set is the {{ATCG|Dreams Come True Collection}}.

==Information==
[[File:Hidden Shadow Logo Indonesian.png|thumb|left|180px|Indonesian logo]]
'''Hidden Shadow''' was released on August 11, 2019 in Thailand, followed by a release in Indonesia on December 30, 2019. The majority of this set comprises cards ranging from the dual {{TCG|Ultra Sun}} and {{TCG|Ultra Moon}} expansions through to the {{TCG|Tag Bolt}} expansion, which include the debut of {{TCG|Prism Star}} Pokémon in the official Thai and Indonesian TCG. It is split into two sets, Set A and Set B, each of which focuses on specific types. Set A features {{TCG|Grass}}, {{TCG|Fire}}, {{TCG|Water}}, {{TCG|Fighting}}, and {{ct|Darkness}} Pokémon, while Set B features {{TCG|Lightning}}, {{TCG|Psychic}}, {{TCG|Metal}}, {{TCG|Fairy}}, {{TCG|Dragon}}, and {{ct|Colorless}} Pokémon. The Thai version has two accompanying pre-constructed {{ATCG|Hidden Shadow GX Starter Decks|GX Starter Decks}}, whereas the Indonesian version has one randomly constructed {{ATCG|Hidden Shadow Random GX Starter Deck|GX Starter Deck}}.

