'''Inferno X''' (Japanese: '''インフェルノ{{ruby|X|エックス}}''') is the name given to the second expansion of cards released during the Japanese [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s MEGA Series. This set features the [[Mega Evolution]] Pokémon, Mega {{p|Charizard}} X.

==Information==
'''Inferno X''' continues to introduce {{TCG|Pokémon ex|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} into the Pokémon Trading Card Game's MEGA Series, including the central Pokémon, {{TCG ID|Inferno X|Mega Charizard X ex|13}}. The set Inferno X also provides various supporting Pokémon and Trainer cards, notably for the {{TCG|Fire}} and {{TCG|Darkness}} types.

Inferno X was released in {{pmin|Japan}} on September 26, 2025, followed by localized releases in Traditional Chinese on October 9, 2025, and in Korean on November 28, 2025. Each booster pack contains 5 cards. Each booster box contains 30 packs.

For the Traditional Chinese release in {{pmin|Taiwan}} and {{pmin|Hong Kong}}, the "10-Pack Set Plus" product is available, which contains 10 booster packs, a cardboard deck case, and a promo card pack. The promo card pack contains one random selection of three sets of Holofoil {{TCTCG|M-P Promotional cards|M-P Promotional}} Pokémon cards with the Inferno X logo on the artwork, plus 5 Basic Energy cards. The M-P Promo selection are as follows:
* Fire set: {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Charmander|20}}, {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Charmeleon|21}}, and {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Moltres|22}}, plus 5 {{TCG|Basic Fire Energy}}
* Metal set: {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Piplup|23}}, {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Prinplup|24}}, and {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Dawn|28}}, plus 5 {{TCG|Basic Metal Energy}}
* Darkness set: {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Sneasel|25}}, {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Carvanha|26}}, and {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Toxel|27}}, plus 5 {{TCG|Basic Darkness Energy}}

The Taiwan and Hong Kong release also introduces the "Inferno X Value Set", a booster box which contains 40 packs instead of the usual 30, a display frame, and a promo pack containing one of the three following Pokémon cards: {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Mega Charizard X ex|29}}, {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Zacian|30}}, and {{TCG ID|M-P Promo|Toxtricity|31}}. Each promo pack also contains 5 Holofoil Basic Energy cards matching the Pokémon's type.

Cards released in this set are included in the English {{TCG|Phantasmal Flames}} expansion.

