'''Sun & Moon: Legends Awakened''' is the name given to the second of six Asian Sun & Moon Era catch-up sets in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It is exclusively available in {{pmin|Indonesia}}n and {{pmin|Thailand|Thai}}. The Traditional Chinese counterpart collection to this set is the {{ATCG|All Stars Collection}}.

==Information==
[[File:Legends Awakened Logo Indonesian.png|thumb|left|180px|Indonesian logo]]
Following on from the {{ATCG|First Impact}} set, this set consists of Sun & Moon Era cards sourced from various Japanese sets. It is split into two sets, Set A and Set B, each of which focuses on specific types. Set A features {{TCG|Grass}}, {{TCG|Lightning}}, {{TCG|Fighting}}, {{TCG|Darkness}}, and {{ct|Dragon}} Pokémon and Set B features {{TCG|Fire}}, {{TCG|Water}}, {{TCG|Psychic}}, {{TCG|Metal}}, and {{ct|Fairy}} Pokémon.

The Thai version of this set and its two companion {{ATCG|Legends Awakened GX Starter Decks|GX Starter Decks}} were available before their official release at Fortune Town in Bangkok, Thailand on May 1, 2019. It was officially released on May 9, 2019. Booster boxes of this set incorrectly stated that there were two SR rarity cards guaranteed in them but only one was guaranteed. Customers were given one UR rarity {{TCG|basic Energy card}} per box.<ref>[https://th.portal-pokemon.com/notice/190508140631_post.html Statement regarding booster boxes]</ref> The Indonesian version was officially available from October 26, 2019 and has only one accompanying {{ATCG|Legends Awakened Random GX Starter Deck|GX Starter Deck}} as opposed to the Thai version's two, which contains a random selection of cards much like the {{ATCG|First Impact GX Starter Deck|first GX Starter Deck}}.

