'''Pokémon TCG: ''Diamond & Pearl—Legends Awakened''''' (Japanese: '''秘境の叫び''' ''Cry from the Mysterious'' and '''怒りの神殿''' ''Temple of Anger'') is the name given to the sixth main expansion of cards from the Diamond & Pearl Series of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It is the fifth main expansion from the DP Era of the Pokémon Card Game in Japan. The set continues to feature [[Generation IV]] Pokémon and {{TCG|Pokémon LV.X}} in the card game.

==Blurb==
<i>Deep in the Far Reaches, Legends Awaken

Become a legend in your own time when you play the Pokémon TCG: Diamond & Pearl—Legends Awakened expansion! Powerful Legendary Pokémon like Regigigas and Heatran, more amazing Pokémon LV.X than ever before, and a host of other game-changing Pokémon will make your battles even more epic. And with new Trainer and Supporter cards, you will awaken the legend within yourself. The legends are rising to the challenge—will you rise with them?</i>

==Information==
'''Legends Awakened''' is the name given to the sixth main expansion of the ''Diamond & Pearl Series'' of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. In Japan, it was released as the '''Cry from the Mysterious''' and '''Temple of Anger''' dual expansions that make up the fifth expansion block in the Pokémon Card Game DP Era. It is based on {{game|Diamond and Pearl|s}}, featuring [[Generation IV]] Pokémon, {{p|Heatran}}, and {{p|Regigigas}}. The English expansion was released on August 20, 2008, while the Japanese expansions were released on March 14, 2008.

In North America, prerelease events were held during the weekends of August 9th–10th, August 16th–17th and August 23rd–24th.<ref>https://web.archive.org/web/20080808041008/http://op.pokemon-tcg.com/events/locator/?event_type=58&location=north_america</ref>

