The Cry from the Mysterious and Temple of Anger sets are only released in Japanese, in both 1st and unlimited edition. The Legends Awakened set is released in English, German, French, Italian, and Spanish. Cards in the English, German, French, and Italian sets were also available as Reverse Holos. The Spanish version of this set lacked any Reverse Holos.

