'''Miracle of the Lakes''' (Korean: '''호수의 기적''' ''Hosu-ui Gijeok'') is the name given to the ninth extension set of cards from the DP Series of the {{pmin|South Korea|Korean}} [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. The set continues to feature {{TCG|Pokémon LV.X}}. This set focuses on {{ct|Psychic}} cards.

==Information==
'''Miracle of the Lakes''' is the ninth Korean extension set of cards after the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] went into hiatus until the middle of 2010. Released February 8, 2011, this extension set continues to introduce both new [[Generation IV]] Pokémon and new {{TCG|Pokémon LV.X}} in the Korean Card Game. This set focuses on {{ct|Psychic}} cards.

Included in the Miracle of the Lakes set are 40 cards originating from the first half of the English Diamond & Pearl Series. The set pulls its Ultra-Rare {{TCG|Pokémon LV.X}} focus from the {{TCG|Legends Awakened}} expansion and contains a majority of cards from it.

The only [[Legendary Pokémon]] included in the set are {{p|Uxie}}, {{p|Mesprit}}, {{p|Azelf}}, {{p|Jirachi}}, {{p|Groudon}}, and {{p|Rayquaza}}.

