'''Neo Discovery''' (Japanese: '''{{ruby|遺跡|いせき}}をこえて...''' ''Crossing the Ruins...'') is the name given to the second main expansion of cards from the Neo Series of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] (the neo Era in Japan). The set continues to feature [[Generation II]] Pokémon in the card game.

==Blurb==
<i>Master the secrets of the Neo Discovery™ set.

What is the relationship between Pokémon and the strange glyphs engraved on the stone walls of the ruins? What new Pokémon will you encounter in the world beyond the forest ruins?</i>

==Information==
'''Neo Discovery''' is the name given to the second main expansion of the ''Neo Series'' of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. In Japan, it was released as '''Crossing the Ruins...''', the second expansion in the Pokémon Card Game neo Era. It is based on {{game|Gold and Silver|s}}, featuring [[Generation II]] Pokémon, {{p|Unown}} and the [[Ruins of Alph]]. The English expansion was released on June 1, 2001, while the Japanese expansion was released on July 7, 2000.

Neo Discovery was expanded again to include Non Holofoil prints of the Rare Holo cards.

