==Trivia==
Even though Pokémon cards are typically ordered first by {{TCG|type}} and then by [[List of Pokémon by National Pokédex number|Pokédex number]], in Obsidian Flames, the {{tcg|ultra rare}} prints of {{TCG ID|Obsidian Flames|Absol ex|214}} (Pokédex number {{p|Absol|#0359}}) and {{TCG ID|Obsidian Flames|Charizard ex|215}} (Pokédex number {{p|Charizard|#0006}}) are numbered 214/197 and 215/197, respectively, despite both being {{ct|Darkness}} Pokémon. In the Japanese Ruler of the Black Flame expansion, {{TCG ID|Ruler of the Black Flame|Charizard ex|125}} does come before {{TCG ID|Ruler of the Black Flame|Absol ex|126}}.

