'''Scarlet & Violet: Paradox Encounters''' (Indonesian: '''Pertemuan Paradoks''') is the name given to the special {{pmin|Indonesia}}n-exclusive set released in the Asian Scarlet & Violet Era of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It is a combination of the Japanese {{TCG|Ancient Roar}} and {{TCG|Future Flash}} expansions.

==Information==
'''Paradox Encounters''' is the second Indonesian-exclusive set for the Asian Scarlet & Violet Era of the {{PTCG}}, released on December 15, 2023. This set combines the Japanese {{TCG|Ancient Roar}} and {{TCG|Future Flash}} expansions, and thus it introduces {{TCG|Ancient}} and {{TCG|Future}} cards to the Indonesian market for the first time. Each booster pack of Paradox Encounters contains 5 cards.

