==Languages this set is released in==
The Spiral Force and Thunder Knuckle sets are released in Japanese and Korean. The Japanese sets are both available in 1st, but only the Thunder Knuckle set of the two is also available in unlimited edition. The Korean sets are only available in unlimited edition. The Plasma Freeze set is released in English, German, French, Italian, Spanish, and Portuguese, with cards also available as Reverse Holos (with the exception of Portuguese, which lacked Reverse Holos).

