'''Sword & Shield: Polychromatic Gathering''' (Chinese: '''剑 & 盾 九彩汇聚''' ''Sword & Shield Polychromatic Gathering'') is the name given to the fourth {{pmin|mainland China|Simplified Chinese}} [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] set in the Sword & Shield Era, and sixth overall set.

==Information==
[[File:CS4 banner.jpg|thumb|300px|Site Banner celebrating the release of the set]]
The set was released on March 1, 2024 and consists of 2 subsets: '''Friend''' (Chinese: '''朋''') and '''Origin''' (Chinese: '''源'''). The Friend subset was assigned expansion mark CS4a, has the [[Eeveelution]]s as its cover Pokémon, and features {{TCG|Single Strike style|Single Strike}} and {{TCG|Rapid Strike style}}s Pokémon. The Origin subset was assigned expansion mark CS4b, has [[Dynamax]] {{p|Mew}}, {{p|Genesect}}, and {{p|Dragapult}} as its cover Pokémon, and features Single Strike, Rapid Strike, and {{TCG|Fusion Strike style}}s Pokémon.

As with all other Asian-exclusive sets, Polychromatic Gathering contains a large selection of cards in an effort to catch up with Japanese and international releases. However, this set also includes [[Holofoil#Reverse Holofoil|Reverse Type Holofoil]] prints of all Common, Uncommon and Rare cards, which are exclusive to Simplified Chinese sets. Another feature exclusive to the Simplified Chinese cards is that all Holofoil cards including Reverse Holofoil have an English Pokémon logo embossed at the bottom left corner of the card under Expansion and [[Standard format (TCG)#Regulation_Marks|Regulation Marks]] as proof of authenticity.<ref>[https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/post_7.html 宝可梦卡牌简中版特有？！卡牌工艺设计介绍来啦~]</ref> [[Secret card (TCG)|Secret cards]] feature an additional watermark with larger Pokémon logo and a latent image of [[Poké Ball]], which is printed inside the card's rule box or on the right of the [[Rarity|rarity symbol]] if the card doesn't have a rule box.

This set comes in two different types of packs:
* 5-card booster packs include 5 cards per pack with one card guaranteed to be either Reverse Holofoil or has a rarity of Rare or above. Each 5-card booster box includes 30 booster packs.
* 25-card booster packs include 25 cards per pack with one guaranteed {{TCG|Pokémon V|Pokémon}}{{TCGV}}card. Each 25-card booster box includes 24 booster packs.

