'''Pokémon TCG: ''XY—Primal Clash''''' (Japanese: '''ガイアボルケーノ''' ''Gaia Volcano'' and '''タイダルストーム''' ''Tidal Storm'') is the name given to the fifth main expansion of cards from the XY Series of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] (the XY Era in Japan). The set continues to feature [[Generation VI]] Pokémon, {{TCG|Pokémon-EX|Pokémon-EX, and M Pokémon-EX}} in the card game.

==Blurb==
<i>Ancient Rivals Awaken!

After centuries asleep, the deep power of Primal Groudon-EX erupts from the land as Primal Kyogre-EX crashes in from the sea, riding titanic waves into battle! With colossal new arrivals like Mega Gardevoir-EX and Mega Aggron-EX, the Pokémon TCG: XY—Primal Clash expansion is alive with the primordial power of Ancient Traits—plus all-new Spirit Link and Special Energy cards! Let the earth shake and the oceans thunder, and get ready for a primal clash like no other!</i>
{{-}}

==Information==
[[File:XY5 Logo.png|200px|thumb|Gaia Volcano • Tidal Storm logos]]
'''Primal Clash''' is the name given to the fifth main expansion of the ''XY Series'' of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. In Japan, it was released as the '''Gaia Volcano''' and '''Tidal Storm''' dual expansions that make up the fifth expansion block in the Pokémon Card Game XY Era. It is based on [[Pokémon Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire]], featuring [[Generation VI]] Pokémon and [[Primal Reversion|Primal]] {{p|Kyogre}} and Primal {{p|Groudon}}. The English expansion was released on February 4, 2015, while the Japanese expansions were released on December 13, 2014.

Primal Clash introduced [[Ancient Trait]]s, special effects which gave Pokémon certain advantages in battle. Ancient Trait cards featured the artwork taking three-quarter of the card, with the remaining one-quarter colored with the Pokémon's type. A bar displaying the Ancient Trait and its effect were located on the top part of the artwork.

Starting from this expansion, {{DL|Pokémon-EX (TCG)|M Pokémon-EX}} were printed as both Regular card and {{TCG|Full Art card}}.

