'''Pokémon TCG: ''Scarlet & Violet—Prismatic Evolutions''''' is the fourth special expansion released during the Scarlet & Violet Series of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. This special expansion, which mainly focuses on {{p|Eevee}} and the [[Eeveelution]]s, was released in English on January 17, 2025.

==Blurb==
''Eevee & Friends Light Up with Stellar Colors!''

''From fluffy and fiery to freezing and fanciful, Eevee and its many Evolutions hold a special place in the hearts of Pokémon Trainers across the land! Discover their unique new powers as Stellar Tera Pokémon ex, and look for treasure of your very own across a grand gathering of Pokémon ex from Paldea and beyond. Glittering gems and hidden patterns await at the end of the rainbow in the Pokémon TCG: Scarlet & Violet—Prismatic Evolutions expansion!''

==Information==
'''Prismatic Evolutions''' introduces {{p|Eevee}} and the [[Eeveelution]]s as Stellar {{Tera}} {{TCG|Pokémon ex}}. This special expansion also introduces two parallel Holofoil variants that may appear on cards, featuring a [[Poké Ball]] or a [[Master Ball]] etched in the background, alongside the regular parallel holofoil variant. Pokémon cards of Common, Uncommon, and Rare rarity are available in all three variants; Trainer cards of Common and Uncommon rarity are available in the regular and Poké Ball variants only.

Prismatic Evolutions contains mostly cards from the Japanese {{TCG|Terastal Fest ex}} subset and {{TCG|Generations Start Decks}}; from the latter, cards relating to Generations {{gen|I}}, {{gen|II}}, {{gen|IV}}, and {{gen|VI}} are included. Prismatic Evolutions contains six {{TCG|ACE SPEC}} Trainer cards, 10 Pokémon ex, 15 Tera Pokémon ex, 12 ultra rare Supporter cards, 32 special illustration rare cards (26 Pokémon ex and 6 Supporter cards), and five hyper rare gold etched Pokémon ex cards. Prismatic Evolutions is available in English, German, French, Italian, Spanish, and Portuguese.

