==Languages this set is released in==
The Emerald Break set is released in Japanese and Korean. The Japanese set is available in both 1st and unlimited edition, and the Korean set is only available in unlimited edition. The Roaring Skies set is released in English, German, French, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, and Russian (the Russian version released on November 20, 2015). Cards in the English, German, French, Italian, Spanish, and Russian sets were also available as Reverse Holos. The Portuguese version of this set lacked any Reverse Holos.

