'''Pokémon TCG: ''Shining Legends''''' (Japanese: '''強化拡張パック ひかる伝説''' ''Enhanced Expansion Pack Shining Legends'') is a special expansion of cards from the Sun & Moon Series of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It was released as the fourth subset from the Sun & Moon Era of the Pokémon Card Game in Japan.

==Blurb==
<i>Blaze a Bright Trail with Shining Pokémon!

In each region, a handful of Pokémon stand apart as creatures of heroic stories and wild adventures: Zekrom, Latios, Mewtwo-GX, Entei-GX. Others are just whispers and rumors: mysterious Pokémon such as Keldeo, Shining Jirachi, Shining Volcanion—and many more! See and collect these astounding Pokémon of myth and legend with the Pokémon TCG: Shining Legends expansion!</i>

==Information==
[[File:SM3Plus Logo.png|200px|thumb|Enhanced Expansion Pack<br>Shining Legends logo]]
'''Shining Legends''' is a special expansion of the ''Sun & Moon Series'' of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. In Japan, it was released as '''Shining Legends''', the fourth subset in the Pokémon Card Game Sun & Moon Era. It was considered as an enhancement of the third Sun & Moon Era main expansion, {{TCG|To Have Seen the Battle Rainbow}} and {{TCG|Darkness that Consumes Light}}.

Shining Legends featured {{TCG|Shining Pokémon}}, a type of Pokémon with {{Shiny|different coloration}} to what is usual for its species.

Unlike regular expansions, Shining Legends booster packs could not be purchased individually from booster boxes. Instead, they were only made available in various set-related merchandise, the first of which was released on October 6, 2017. Each booster pack contained 11 cards, with 2 guaranteed foil cards.

The Japanese subset was released on July 15, 2017 to coincide with the [[M20|twentieth Pokémon movie]] and included several Legendary and Mythical Pokémon that were featured in all the [[Pokémon movie]]s released at the time.

