'''Scarlet & Violet: Sparkling Fable''' (Simplified Chinese: '''朱&紫 璀璨诡幻''') is the eighth {{pmin|mainland China|Simplified Chinese}} [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] expansion of the Scarlet & Violet Series.

== Information ==
[[File:CSV8 banner.png|thumb|300px|Set banner artwork]]
'''Sparkling Fable''' is the eighth Scarlet & Violet expansion to be released in the Simplified Chinese language version of the Pokémon Trading Card Game. The expansion focuses on {{p|Ogerpon}}, which appears in all of its special {{Tera}}stallized forms, as well as the [[Loyal Three]] and their leader, {{p|Pecharunt}}. Most of its cards originate from the Japanese {{TCG|Transformation Mask}} and {{TCG|Night Wanderer}} sets, as well as a small number from other sets and products, including {{TCG|Crimson Haze}}, {{TCG|Stellar Miracle}}, {{TCG|Paradise Dragona}}, and {{TCG|Super Electric Breaker}}.

Sparkling Fable features one card exclusive to the Simplified Chinese language: a {{TCG|special illustration rare}} print of {{TCG|Carmine}}.

In total, excluding the aforementioned exclusive card, the set's cards originate from the following Japanese releases:
* 86 cards from {{TCG|Transformation Mask}};
* 76 cards from {{TCG|Night Wanderer}};
* 32 cards from {{TCG|Stellar Miracle}};
* 23 cards from {{TCG|Crimson Haze}};
* 20 cards from {{TCG|Super Electric Breaker}};
* 18 cards from {{TCG|Paradise Dragona}};
* 5 cards from the {{TCG|Generations Start Decks}};
* 2 cards from {{TCG|Cyber Judge}};
* 1 card from {{TCG|Glory of the Rocket Gang}} (the {{rar|UR}} print of {{TCG|Jamming Tower}}, the regular print of which was included from Transformation Mask).

Cards are available in two different types of booster packs:

* 5-card booster packs; one card is either Reverse Holofoil or have a rarity of {{rar|R}} or higher;
* 20-card booster packs; six cards are either Reverse Holofoil or have a rarity of {{rar|R}} of higher.

Each of the 176 common, uncommon, and rare cards in the expansion come in two Reverse Holofoil variants - one with a Poké Ball motif, and a rarer one with a Master Ball motif.

