'''Pokémon TCG: ''XY—Steam Siege''''' (Japanese: '''{{ruby|爆熱|ばくねつ}}の{{ruby|闘士|とうし}}''' ''Fever-Burst Fighter'' and '''{{ruby|冷酷|れいこく}}の{{ruby|反逆者|はんぎゃくしゃ}}''' ''Cruel Traitor'') is the name given to the eleventh main expansion of cards from the XY Series of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It is the fourth and final main expansion from the XY BREAK Era of the Pokémon Card Game in Japan. The set continues to feature [[Generation VI]] Pokémon, {{TCG|Pokémon-EX|Pokémon-EX, M Pokémon-EX}}, and {{TCG|Pokémon BREAK}} in the card game.

==Blurb==
<i>Dual Powers Clash!

Long years of stability come to an end when Shiny Mega Gardevoir-EX lays siege to the mighty Gear Palace with a host of greedy forces. The Mythical Steam Pokémon Volcanion must wield the dual powers of fire and water to stop them! As the battle rages, Xerneas BREAK and Yveltal BREAK face off in the Pokémon TCG: XY—Steam Siege expansion!</i>

==Information==
[[File:XY11 Logo.png|200px|thumb|Fever-Burst Fighter • Cruel Traitor logos]]
'''Steam Siege''' is the name given to the eleventh main expansion of the ''XY Series'' of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. In Japan, it was released as the '''Fever-Burst Fighter''' and '''Cruel Traitor''' dual expansions that make up the fourth and final expansion in the Pokémon Card Game XY BREAK Era. It is based on [[Pokémon X and Y]], featuring [[Generation VI]] Pokémon and the Steam Pokémon {{p|Volcanion}}. The English expansion was released on August 3, 2016, while the Japanese expansions were released on June 17, 2016.

Steam Siege featured dual-type Pokémon, in which Pokémon have a secondary type. The Pokémon in the artwork is in its {{Shiny}} form. A diagonal line strikes across the card from the top-right to the bottom-left corner, with each side having the Pokémon's different type color.

