'''Scarlet & Violet: Stellar Lightning''' is the name given to the special set released in the Asian Scarlet & Violet Era of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It is largely a combination of the Japanese {{TCG|Paradise Dragona}} and {{TCG|Super Electric Breaker}} sets, and is exclusively released in {{pmin|Indonesia}} and {{pmin|Thailand}}.

==Information==
'''Stellar Lightning''', known in Indonesian as '''Kilat Rasi''' (lit. "Constellation Lightning") and in Thai as '''สเตลลาร์สายฟ้าฟาด''' (lit. "Stellar Lightning Strike"), is a special set exclusive to Indonesia and Thailand released for the Asian Scarlet & Violet Era of the {{PTCG}}. It is the sixth such set for the Indonesian market, and the second such set for the Thai market. Compositionally, it combines the Japanese {{TCG|Paradise Dragona}} and {{TCG|Super Electric Breaker}} sets, as well as miscellaneous cards from the {{TCG|Stellar Tera Type Starter Sets}} that were yet to be localized into Indonesian and Thai, making Stellar Lightning essentially the Indonesian and Thai equivalent of the English {{TCG|Surging Sparks}} expansion. Each booster pack of Stellar Lightning contains 5 cards.

Stellar Lightning was released in Indonesia on November 29, 2024, and in Thailand on December 13, 2024. A Collector's Set (Indonesian: '''Set Kolektor'''; Thai: '''ชุดพิเศษเพื่อนักสะสม''') for Stellar Lightning was available for sale on the same day. Similar to the Traditional Chinese {{TCG|Super Electric Breaker}} Collector's Set, the Indonesian and Thai Stellar Lightning Collector's Set contains 10 booster packs, a card list booklet, and a stamped Full Art promo card of {{TCG ID|SV-P Promo|Alolan Dugtrio|209}}.

Besides being sold in individual boosters and boxes of 30 packs, Stellar Lightning is also available in 2-pack blisters known as "Special Set" (Indonesian: '''Set Spesial'''; Thai: '''สเปเชียลเซ็ต'''). Special Set blisters are exclusively sold in convenience store chain {{wp|Indomaret}} in Indonesia beginning December 21, 2024, and in convenience store chain {{wp|7-Eleven}} in Thailand beginning December 23, 2024. Each Special Set contains a Holo promo card of {{TCG ID|SV-P Promo|Fuecoco|206}}, {{TCG ID|SV-P Promo|Togepi|207}}, or {{TCG ID|SV-P Promo|Alolan Diglett|208}} with the Stellar Lightning logo stamped on the bottom right corner of the artwork.

