'''Super Electric Breaker''' (Japanese: '''超電ブレイカー''' ''Super Electric Breaker'') is the name given to the eighth Japanese expansion of cards released during the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s Scarlet & Violet Era.

==Information==
'''Super Electric Breaker''' continues to introduce {{type|Stellar}} {{Tera}} {{TCG|Pokémon ex}} into the meta, with Terastal Pikachu ex as its central Pokémon. A general theme based on the [[Blueberry Academy]] is present within the set as well.

Super Electric Breaker was released in {{pmin|Japan}} on October 18, 2024, followed by localized releases in {{pmin|Chinese|Traditional Chinese}} on October 25, 2024, and in {{pmin|South Korea|Korean}} on November 27, 2024. Each booster box of Super Electric Breaker contains 30 {{TCG|booster pack}}s. The {{pmin|Indonesia}}n and {{pmin|Thailand|Thai}} equivalent set, {{ATCG|Stellar Lightning}}, was released on November 29, 2024 and December 13, 2024 respectively. Cards within this set are included in the English {{TCG|Surging Sparks}} expansion.

