==Languages this set is released in==
The Sword and Shield sets are released in Japanese and Korean, only available in unlimited edition. Since the Sun & Moon era, Japanese 1st edition cards are no longer printed. The Sword & Shield set is released in English, German, French, Italian, Spanish, and Portuguese, with cards in those languages also available as Reverse Holos.

