'''Pokémon TCG: ''Scarlet & Violet—Temporal Forces''''' (Japanese: '''ワイルドフォース''' ''Wild Force'' and '''サイバージャッジ''' ''Cyber Judge'') is the name given to the set that makes up the fifth expansion of cards from the Scarlet & Violet Series of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It released in English on March 22, 2024, and released in Japanese on January 26, 2024.

==Blurb==
<i>Ancient & Future Powers Endure!

The ranks of Ancient and Future Pokémon continue to grow! Walking Wake ex breaks free of the past alongside Raging Bolt ex, while Iron Leaves ex delivers high-tech justice with Iron Crown ex. Outside Area Zero, Wugtrio and Farigiraf shift types as Tera Pokémon ex, and Pokémon Trainers everywhere prepare for the return of ACE SPEC cards with uniquely powerful effects. A rupture in time brings wild beasts and cyber visions to battle in the Pokémon TCG: Scarlet & Violet—Temporal Forces expansion!</i>

==Information==
[[File:SV5 Logo JP.png|200px|thumb|Wild Force & Cyber Judge logos]]
The '''Temporal Forces''' set and the Japanese '''Wild Force''' and '''Cyber Judge''' sets continue to introduce {{TCG|Ancient}} and {{TCG|Future}} Pokémon and Trainer cards into the Pokémon Trading Card Game. The central Pokémon in these sets are the trios of [[Paradox Pokémon]] resembling the [[Legendary beasts]] and the [[Swords of Justice]]: {{p|Walking Wake}}, {{p|Gouging Fire}}, {{p|Raging Bolt}}, {{p|Iron Leaves}}, {{p|Iron Boulder}}, and {{p|Iron Crown}}.

These sets also reintroduced {{TCG|ACE SPEC card}}s. First introduced in the Black & White Series of the TCG, ACE SPEC cards are powerful cards with the restriction that only one ACE SPEC card of any sort can be included in a deck. ACE SPEC cards as of this set have a unique magenta design, and can come in Trainer and {{TCG|Special Energy card}}s.

Temporal Forces includes cards from the Japanese Wild Force and Cyber Judge expansions, as well as the Japanese {{TCG|Starter Deck & Build Sets}}. Temporal Forces contains seven {{TCG|ACE SPEC card|ACE SPEC}} Trainer and Special Energy cards, thirteen {{TCG|Pokémon ex}}, two Tera Pokémon ex, 22 {{TCG|illustration rare}} Pokémon, ten {{TCG|special illustration rare}} Pokémon and Supporter cards, and six {{TCG|hyper rare}} gold etched cards.

Temporal Forces is available in English, German, French, Italian, Spanish, and Portuguese. Wild Force and Cyber Judge are released in Japanese on January 26, 2024, followed by localized releases in {{pmin|Chinese|Traditional Chinese}} on February 2, 2024, in {{pmin|Thailand|Thai}} on February 23, 2024, and in {{pmin|South Korea|Korean}} on March 6, 2024. The {{pmin|Indonesia}}n set equivalent, {{ATCG|Ace Paradox}}, released on March 29, 2024. In the English set and the languages following the English set structure, all Rares and below are also available as Reverse Holofoil versions.

