'''Scarlet & Violet: Terastal Gathering''' (Simplified Chinese: '''朱&紫 太晶盛聚''') is the second {{pmin|mainland China|Simplified Chinese}} [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] subset of the Scarlet & Violet Series.

== Information ==
'''Terastal Gathering''' largely follows the theme of the Japanese {{TCG|Terastal Fest ex}} subset, focusing on {{p|Eevee}} and [[Eeveelution|its Evolutions]] and featuring them all as [[Pokémon ex (TCG)#Tera Pokémon ex|Stellar Tera Pokémon ex]], while also including many reprinted cards from the previous block of sets and a large selection of new secret prints for existing cards as well.

Unlike previous Scarlet & Violet sets, Terastal Gathering is available in only one kind of booster pack: a 10-card booster pack, of which either three or four of the cards are either Mirror Holofoil or have a rarity of {{rar|R}} or higher. Additionally, all of the set's common, uncommon, and rare cards come in the same two Mirror Holofoil variants as Terastal Fest ex - one with a crystallized Poké Ball motif, and a rarer one with a crystallized Master Ball motif; however, unlike in Terastal Fest ex, {{TCG|Trainer card}}s and {{TCG|Energy card}}s of those rarities can also feature the Master Ball motif.

Terastal Gathering features one card exclusive to the Simplified Chinese language: a {{TCG|special illustration rare}} print of {{OBP|Sylveon ex|Terastal Gathering 234}}.

