'''Scarlet & Violet: Transfiguration Mask''' (Indonesian: '''Topeng Transfigurasi''') is the name given to the special {{pmin|Indonesia}}n-exclusive set released in the Asian Scarlet & Violet Era of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. It is the Indonesian equivalent of the English {{TCG|Twilight Masquerade}} expansion, being a combination of the Japanese {{TCG|Crimson Haze}} and {{TCG|Transformation Mask}} sets.

==Information==
'''Transfiguration Mask''' is the fourth Indonesian-exclusive set for the Asian Scarlet & Violet Era of the {{PTCG}}. It combines the Japanese {{TCG|Crimson Haze}} and {{TCG|Transformation Mask}} sets — thus, in terms of set composition, it is practically almost identical to the English {{TCG|Twilight Masquerade}} expansion. The only differences between the Indonesian and English sets are the order of Trainer cards, the reprint of {{TCG ID|Transfiguration Mask|Switch|148}} and {{TCG ID|Transfiguration Mask|Pokémon Catcher|150}} (which were replaced in the English release with {{TCG|Twilight Masquerade|Cook|147}} and {{TCG|Twilight Masquerade|Raifort|161}}), and the inclusion of the {{TCG|illustration rare}} prints of {{TCG|Twilight Masquerade|Okidogi|111}}, {{TCG|Twilight Masquerade|Munkidori|95}}, and {{TCG|Twilight Masquerade|Fezandipiti|96}}, which were cut from the English release. Transfiguration Mask releases in Indonesia on May 31, 2024, and each booster pack of Transfiguration Mask contains 5 cards.

Besides being sold in individual boosters and boxes of 30 packs, Transfiguration Mask is also available in 2-pack blisters known as "Special Set" (Indonesian: '''Set Spesial'''), which are exclusively sold in Indonesian convenience store chain {{wp|Indomaret}}. Each Special Set contains a Holo promo card of {{TCG ID|SV-P Promo|Grookey|127}}, {{TCG ID|SV-P Promo|Clefairy|128}}, or {{TCG ID|SV-P Promo|Eevee|129}} with the Transfiguration Mask logo stamped on the bottom right corner of the artwork. A Collector's Set (Indonesian: '''Set Kolektor''') for Transfiguration Mask is also available for sale at card game stores. Similar to the Traditional Chinese {{TCG|Transformation Mask}} Collector's Set, the Indonesian Transfiguration Mask Collector's Set contains 10 booster packs, a card list booklet, and a stamped Full Art promo card of {{TCG ID|SV-P Promo|Chansey|130}}.

