==Languages this set is released in==
The Clash at the Summit set is only released in Japanese, in both {{TCG|1st Edition}} and Unlimited Edition. All cards in this Japanese set, including the {{TCG|Pokémon Prime}} cards but excluding all {{TCG|Pokémon LEGEND}} cards and {{TCG ID|Clash at the Summit|Alph Lithograph|81}}, were also available in [[Reverse Holofoil]]. The Triumphant set is released in English, German, French, and Italian, with cards also available in Reverse Holofoil.

