==Languages this set is released in==
The Double Blaze set is released in Japanese and Korean, only available in unlimited edition. Since the Sun & Moon era, Japanese 1st edition cards are no longer printed. The Unbroken Bonds set is released in English, German, French, Italian, Spanish, and Portuguese, with cards in those languages also available as Reverse Holos.

